{"ref":"BDB, יוֹבֵל","hw":"יוֹבֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹבֵל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹבֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Numbers 36:4\" href=\"/Numbers.36.4\">Nu 36:4</a></sup> <strong>ram, ram’s horn, cornet (</strong>Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">יבל</span> <em>ram;</em> cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.10\">Lv 25:10</a> Dl<sup>Pr 124</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹבֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:5\" href=\"/Joshua.6.5\">Jos 6:5</a> + 7 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹבֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:13\" href=\"/Exodus.19.13\">Ex 19:13</a> + 13 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹבְלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:4\" href=\"/Joshua.6.4\">Jos 6:4</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹבְלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:13\" href=\"/Joshua.6.13\">Jos 6:13</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>ram</em>, only in combin.: <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּמְשֹׁךְ בְּקֶרֶן הַיּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:5\" href=\"/Joshua.6.5\">Jos 6:5</a> <em>the ram’s horn,</em> as wind-instrument; so <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹפְרוֹת (ה)י(ו)בלים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:4\" href=\"/Joshua.6.4\">Jos 6:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:6\" href=\"/Joshua.6.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:8\" href=\"/Joshua.6.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:13\" href=\"/Joshua.6.13\">13</a> <em>rams’ horns</em> (v. Benz<sup>Archäol. 276</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹבֵל</span> alone, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּמְשֹׁךְ הַיֹּבֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:13\" href=\"/Exodus.19.13\">Ex 19:13</a> <em>at the sounding of the ram</em>(’s horn).<br><strong>2.</strong>  designation of 50th year, marked by blowing of cornets, AV ‘jubile’ (so NH <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹבֵל</span>, 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">יובֵילָא</span>, as loan-word); orig. no doubt <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת הַיּוֹבֵל</span> <em>year of the ram</em>(’s horn), as <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.13\">Lv 25:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:40\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.40\">40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:50\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.50\">50</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:52\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.52\">52</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:54\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.54\">54</a> (all H), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.17\">27:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.24\">24</a> (all P), but then, without <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁנת</span>, as <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹבֵל הִוא תִּהְיֶה לָכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.10\">25:10</a> <em>a ram</em>(’s horn blowing) <em>shall it be to you;</em> so v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">33</a> (all H), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.18\">27:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.21\">21</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 36:4\" href=\"/Numbers.36.4\">Nu 36:4</a> (both P).","next":"BDB, יַבָּל","prev":"BDB, בּוּל³"}